 rich with themes of family, reconciliation, and personal growth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Detailed Environments:</strong> Explore a beautifully crafted antique shop filled with historical and atmospheric details.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Character-driven Experience:</strong> Witness Lily's journey of understanding and healing as she confronts the past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive Gameplay:</strong> Engage with a variety of items and puzzles to unlock new memories and advance the story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786650/extras/potp_artist_box.gif?t=1744372697\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join Lily in Pieces of the Past, where every repaired item brings a new revelation, and every</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">memory helps her rebuild the bonds of her family and shape her future. Rediscover the past </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">to shape your destiny.</p>","developers":["Marzailles"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786650/header.jpg?t=1744372697","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1024 MB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4 GHZ<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1024 MB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available spac